    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord channel</h1><p>Be sure to join the Root of Win Discord server to keep up with the latest updates! (and for report bugs..)<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Root of Win is a 3D puzzle game with lots of interesting mechanics, music and small details that are only visible during gameplay.<br><br>Root of Win single player game presents a new type of puzzle where you can follow different paths to reach the end and shed light on the creation of this world.<br><br>Multiplayer mode for two players provides even more interesting gameplay, unique levels, mechanics and diverse cooperation with your friend. In co-op, you can play with your friend and communicate in the built-in voice chat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 singleplayer levels</li><li>10 cooperative levels</li><li>Fully original music</li><li>A lot of interesting game mechanics</li><li>Never seen before style of game</li><li>Multiplayer cooperative for two players</li><li>Many ways to communicate with friend in the cooperative game</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Root of Win is a 3D puzzle game with lots of interesting mechanics, music and small details that are only visible during gameplay.<br><br>Root of Win single player game presents a new type of puzzle where you can follow different paths to reach the end and shed light on the creation of this world.<br><br>Multiplayer mode for two players provides even more interesting gameplay, unique levels, mechanics and diverse cooperation with your friend. In co-op, you can play with your friend and communicate in the built-in voice chat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 singleplayer levels</li><li>10 cooperative levels</li><li>Fully original music</li><li>A lot of interesting game mechanics</li><li>Never seen before style of game</li><li>Multiplayer cooperative for two players</li><li>Many ways to communicate with friend in the cooperative game</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Root of Win is a 3D puzzle game where you solve levels with a friend in a co-op or alone.",
